<div id="boot"><div><svg class="mk"><use href="#mk"/></svg><p style="animation-delay:.2s">NEVAEH // identity kernel … <b>online</b></p><p style="animation-delay:.7s">operating layer … <b>connecting</b></p><p style="animation-delay:1.2s">memory contract … <b>consent required</b></p></div></div>
<canvas id="bg"></canvas><div class="scan"></div>
<div class="app"><header><div class="brand"><svg class="mk"><use href="#mk"/></svg>LIGHTEK<em>/</em><b>NEVAEH</b><a class="back" href="/dashboard">Dashboard ↗</a></div>
<div class="chips"><span><i></i>Connecting</span><span>Permission checks · active</span><span>Memory · opt in</span><span id="clk">--:--:--</span></div></header>
<main>
<aside class="panel"><div class="grab"></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Agents <small>constellation</small></h3><div class="ags" id="ags"></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Mission control <small>one platform</small></h3><div class="quick"><button data-command="/help">Command vocabulary</button><button data-command="/resources">Resource contracts</button><button data-command="/capabilities">Platform capabilities</button><button data-command="/status">My activity</button></div><div id="operations" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3 id="workforce">Agent workforce <small>real workers</small></h3><div class="quick"><button data-command="/agents">Agents &amp; jobs</button><button data-command="/delegate sage susu.list">Delegate to Sage</button></div><div id="agent-jobs" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
<div class="g" id="host-tools" hidden><h3>Application fabric <small>Ubuntu + Rails</small></h3><div class="quick"><button data-command="/ubuntu status">Ubuntu host</button><button data-command="/ubuntu search video">Find applications</button><button data-command="/models">Rails models</button><button data-command="/resources">API contracts</button></div><label class="upload-label">Application input file<input id="app-upload" type="file"></label></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Memory contract <small>you decide</small></h3><div id="mc"></div><h3 style="margin-top:14px">Remembered <small id="rc">0</small></h3><div id="rem"><p class="empty" style="margin:0">Nothing stored yet. Nevaeh asks before she remembers.</p></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Activity <small>live receipts</small></h3><div id="lint"></div></div>
</aside>
<section class="core" id="core"><canvas aria-label="Illustrative identity wheel; not an astronomical ephemeris" id="wheel"></canvas><div class="mtabs"><button id="ta">Agents · Memory</button><button id="tb">Ethics · Why</button><button id="tdm">Today</button></div>
<div class="tl g"><div class="r1"><span>Transits</span><b id="tdl">today</b></div><div class="r2"><button id="tnow" title="Back to today">Now</button><input type="range" id="ts" min="-730" max="730" value="0" aria-label="Transit date"><button id="tp" title="Play through time">▶</button></div></div>
<div class="read"><div class="system-label">LIGHTEK OPERATING INTELLIGENCE</div><h2 class="grad" id="rn">Nevaeh</h2><p id="rl"></p><button class="btn s" id="tdb">Today’s briefing</button></div>
<div class="low"><div class="accuracy">Identity wheel · approximate chart preview · actions follow permissions and evidence</div><div id="trail"></div>
<article class="g" id="ans"><div class="ah"><span id="aq">—</span><b id="aa">Nevaeh</b></div><div id="at" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="receipt"></div><div class="tags" id="atags"></div><div class="mem" id="mem"><span id="mt"></span><button class="btn s" id="my">Remember</button><button class="btn m" id="mn">Not this</button></div></article>
<div class="dock"><div class="dk"><div class="modes" id="modes"><button class="on">Converse</button><button>Operate</button><button>Decide</button><button>Reflect</button></div><span class="spk">Speak<button type="button" class="sw" id="spk" aria-label="Speak replies"></button></span></div><form class="in" id="f"><input id="q" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Talk to Nevaeh… or type /help" aria-label="Ask Nevaeh"><button class="btn m mic" id="mic" type="button" aria-label="Voice input">Voice</button><button class="btn s" type="submit">Send</button></form></div></div></section>
<aside class="panel"><div class="grab"></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Operating principles <small id="ev">observable checks</small></h3><div id="eth"></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Chart preview <small id="td">illustrative</small></h3><div id="tr"></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Why she answered this way <small>execution evidence</small></h3><div id="inf"><p class="empty" style="margin:0">Ask something. Her evidence and action receipts will appear here.</p></div></div>
<div class="g"><h3>Persona generator <small>persona studio</small></h3><p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--mut);font-size:12px">Create a saved persona with its own visual identity and voice. All agents share your account permissions.</p><button class="btn s" id="gen" style="width:100%">Generate agent</button></div>
</aside></main></div>
<div class="mo" id="mo"><form class="g" id="gf"><h3>New agent <small>from natal data</small></h3><label>Name<input name="n" required maxlength="18" placeholder="e.g. Noor"></label><label>Birth date<input name="d" type="date" required value="1992-05-17"></label><label>Birth time<input name="t" type="time" value="09:30"></label><label>Birth place<input name="p" placeholder="City, Country"></label><div style="display:flex;gap:10px"><button class="btn s" type="submit" style="flex:1">Generate</button><button class="btn m" type="button" id="gx">Cancel</button></div></form></div>
<div class="bo" id="bo"><div class="bx g" role="dialog" aria-label="Daily briefing">
<div class="bh"><div><span class="eb" id="bw">Daily briefing</span><h2 class="grad" id="bd">Today</h2></div><div class="bn"><button id="bpv" aria-label="Previous day">◀</button><button id="bto">Today</button><button id="bnx" aria-label="Next day">▶</button><button id="bcl" aria-label="Close">✕</button></div></div>
<div class="bm"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" id="moon"></svg><div><b id="bms"></b><span id="bmp"></span></div></div>
<p class="bq" id="bq"></p><div class="b3" id="bk"></div><div class="b3 fr" id="bl" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
<div class="bi"><input id="bin" maxlength="90" placeholder="Set today’s intention…" aria-label="Today’s intention"><button class="btn s" id="bis">Save</button></div>
<div class="ba"><button class="btn m" id="bhr">Hear it</button><button class="btn s" id="bas">Ask about this</button></div><div class="be" id="be"></div></div></div>
<div id="sbg"></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
<script src="/nevaeh/os.js?v=2" defer></script></body></html>
